d Str – New York, N.Y.)/'Wave' – (1923) Pastel/by Georgia O'Keeffe/44 Selected paintings/(1915–1927) January 29–March 17/34\" (Alfred Stieglitz, black ink). Downtown Gallery Archive dates 1923. Dated 1922 on basis of inclusion in 1923 New York (Anderson) exhibition, pictured in Stieglitz installation photograph, see Appendix III, figure 13. Orientation based on installation photograph. See cat. nos. 381–83, 385–87. (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/713793/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/713793"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"}],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}